        "execSummary":  "Delegated user authorization has been one of the most underestimated blockers to enterprise agentic AI deployment — this update directly solves it by providing a managed OAuth consent layer inside Amazon Bedrock AgentCore. For enterprises building agents that interact with SaaS tools, CRMs, or internal systems on behalf of employees or customers, this eliminates the need to build and maintain custom identity-plumbing infrastructure. The practical impact is faster time-to-production for agentic workflows and reduced security risk from custom token-management code. AI platform and architecture teams should assess how AgentCore\u0027s consent portal fits their existing identity provider setup before designing new agent integrations.",
