        "execSummary":  "A 90% reduction in input token costs for repeated-context workloads is a material budget lever for any enterprise running AI at scale — this post makes the technique concrete and actionable across six real-world scenarios. For leaders managing AI infrastructure costs, prompt caching is the single highest-return optimization available on Amazon Bedrock today and requires no model changes or quality tradeoffs. Customer-support AI deployments — where the same knowledge base or policy documents are sent with every request — stand to gain the most from this pattern. The key implication: any enterprise Bedrock deployment not yet using prompt caching should treat this as an immediate cost-reduction opportunity, not a future roadmap item.",
